# <type>(<scope>): <summary>
#
# Explain why the change is needed and how behavior changes.
# Body: at least 20 characters; optional for docs.
#
# Optional footer:
# Fixes #<issue>
#
# BREAKING CHANGE: <summary>
#
# Explain the impact and migration steps.
#
# Types: build, ci, docs, feat, fix, perf, refactor, test
# Reverts: revert: <original header>; include the SHA and reason in the body.
# Scope: choose a project area, or omit for changes spanning several areas.
# Summary: English, imperative, lowercase initial, no final period.
# Full guide: docs/commit-message-guidelines.md
